  "description": "Named after one of our go-to trail networks, the Daley is our all-new, all-mountain 29er, ready for the climb & grind. Starting with our exclusive aluminum frame design, the Daley is built on a trusted suspension platform with 150/140mm travel, custom tuned for each spec level. This is our go-to all mountain machine: Playful on the trails, with maximum traction through the turns and on the climbs. Ready to launch the jumps, turn and burn. No gimmicks, nothing wacky, just everything you need for days in the dirt.",
